questmarks-ui -- attribution and asset provenance
=================================================

This file accounts for everything the addon puts on screen that it did not draw
itself. questmarks' own NOTICE covers the quest and mission DATA and applies
unchanged here; this one covers the ART.

WHAT THIS IS. An unofficial, non-commercial fan tool for Final Fantasy XI, with
no affiliation to or endorsement by SQUARE ENIX. FFXI game content and
materials are (C) SQUARE ENIX CO., LTD.

NO TEXT IS SHIPPED. The step notes and quest descriptions the detail pane draws
are read off your own disk from questmarks' build/authored/ and build/rendered/
at runtime. Nothing in this addon contains them, which is what keeps the
constraint questmarks' own emitter observes observed here too: reading a file
you already have is not redistributing it. Without those directories both
features are simply absent.


